+    "domain_essentiality": "licensed_reduction",
+    "reduction_kind": "paper_licensed",
+    "reduction": (
+        "Section 2, Figure 1(a) and the variable/edge-gadget lemmas: a flip "
+        "forces opposite directions and two stacked flips force equal outer "
+        "directions"
+    ),
+    "reduction_source": "paper_central",
+    "intuition_type": "symmetry",
+    "intuition_description": (
+        "The GF(2) constraint rows are the complements of the coordinate "
+        "basis, so a dense system collapses to one global parity and "
