- [placebo transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1804.07496/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

The only blocker is external: every OpenRouter request returned HTTP 403, “Key limit exceeded (total limit),” across OpenAI, Anthropic, and xAI. Consequently, there is no fabricated hardness verdict and the result is not yet submission-ready. After restoring quota, rerun:

```bash
cd /home/gson/gvrepo/results/1804.07496
python3 ../../scripts/harden.py gen_1804_07496.py
```
diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
